---
description: Bump extension version patch on every commit; major versions are owner-only
globs: extension/manifest.json
alwaysApply: true
---

# Version on commit

- **On every push or sync**: Update the **patch** version number in `extension/manifest.json` (e.g. `1.3.1` → `1.3.2`).
- **Major version changes**: Leave these to the project owner; do not bump major (or minor unless asked).
- Version field is in `extension/manifest.json` under `"version"`.
